#. :src: Socket name from node group Roll Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Retain Overall Shape"
msgstr "Behåll övergripande form"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Roll Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Offset the roll along the original curve to retain shape"
msgstr "Förskjut rullningen längs originalkurvan för att behålla formen"

#. :src: Socket name from node group Roll Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Roll Direction"
msgstr "Rullningsriktning"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Roll Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Axis around which each curve is rolled"
msgstr "Axel som varje kurva rullas kring"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Roll Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Amount of randomization of the direction of the roll"
msgstr "Mängden slumpvariation i rullningsriktningen"

#. :src: Asset name from file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Rotate Hair Curves"
msgstr "Rotera hårkurvor"

#. :src: Asset description from file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Rotates each hair curve around an axis"
msgstr "Roterar varje hårkurva kring en axel"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Set Hair Curve Profile, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Base radius to be set if 'Replace Radius' is enabled"
msgstr "Basradie som ska ställas in om \"Ersätt radie\" är aktiverat"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Set Hair Curve Profile, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Factor of the radius at the minimum"
msgstr "Radiefaktor vid minimum"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Set Hair Curve Profile, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Factor of the radius at the maximum"
msgstr "Radiefaktor vid maximum"

#. :src: Asset description from file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid ""
"Shrinkwraps hair curves to a mesh surface from below and optionally from "
"above"
msgstr "Anpassar hårkurvor till en meshyta underifrån och vid behov ovanifrån"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Shrinkwrap Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Surface geometry used for shrinkwrap"
msgstr "Ytgeometri som används för Shrinkwrap"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Shrinkwrap Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Surface object used for shrinkwrap"
msgstr "Ytobjekt som används för Shrinkwrap"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Shrinkwrap Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Distance from the surface used for shrinkwrap"
msgstr "Avstånd från ytan som används för Shrinkwrap"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Shrinkwrap Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Blend shrinkwrap for points above the surface"
msgstr "Blanda Shrinkwrap-effekten för punkter ovanför ytan"

#. :src: Socket name from node group Shrinkwrap Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Smoothing Steps"
msgstr "Utjämningssteg"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Shrinkwrap Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Amount of steps of smoothing applied after shrinkwrap"
msgstr "Antal utjämningssteg som tillämpas efter Shrinkwrap"

#. :src: Asset name from file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Smooth Hair Curves"
msgstr "Jämna ut hårkurvor"

#. :src: Asset description from file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Smoothes the shape of hair curves"
msgstr "Jämnar ut hårkurvornas form"

#. :src: Socket name from node group Smooth Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Lock Tips"
msgstr "Lås spetsar"

#. :src: Asset name from file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Straighten Hair Curves"
msgstr "Räta ut hårkurvor"

#. :src: Asset description from file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Straightens hair curves between root and tip"
msgstr "Rätar ut hårkurvor mellan rot och spets"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Straighten Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Amount of straightening"
msgstr "Mängd uträtning"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Trim Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Mask to blend overall effect"
msgstr "Mask för att blanda den övergripande effekten"

#. :src: Asset name from file smooth_by_angle.blend
msgid "Smooth by Angle"
msgstr "Jämna ut efter vinkel"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Smooth by Angle, file smooth_by_angle.blend
msgid "Maximum face angle for smooth edges"
msgstr "Största vinkeln mellan ytor för mjuka kanter"
